<section class="container problem">
  <h2>The code runs on another machine. Your browser is on this one.</h2>
  <p>
    Today that means an <code>ssh -L</code> flag for every port, a certificate warning on every
    load, and hot reload that never connects. Nearhost sets that up once per project and gives each
    one a name you can open.
  </p>
</section>

